flowchart TD
    M[main.jsx - ReactDOM render] --> TP[ToastProvider wraps App]
    TP --> APP[App.jsx]
    APP -->|GET /api/health on mount| HEALTH[health state]
    APP --> UD[useDocuments hook]
    APP --> UC[useChat hook]
    UD -->|GET /api/documents, poll 2.5s while waiting/processing| DOCS[documents state]
    UC --> SS[(sessionStorage doculens.chat.messages)]

    APP --> L[Layout.jsx - header + health pill]
    L --> SB[Sidebar.jsx]
    L --> CW[ChatWindow.jsx]

    SB --> UP[UploadPanel.jsx - drag and drop, client-side checks, progress bars]
    UP -->|onUpload -> POST /api/documents/upload with onUploadProgress| UD
    SB --> DC[DocumentCard.jsx - name, size, pages, status badge, inline delete confirm]
    DC --> PS[ProcessingStatus.jsx - spinner text]
    DC -->|DELETE /api/documents/id after confirm| UD
    SB --> SP[SummaryPanel.jsx - first ready doc]
    SP -->|GET /api/documents/id/summary?mode=| SUM[summary card]

    CW --> ES[EmptyState.jsx - when no docs and no messages]
    CW --> CHIPS[example question chips - fill input]
    CW --> CM[ChatMessage.jsx - user bubble / assistant card]
    CM --> EB[evidence status badge]
    CM --> VW[verification warnings box]
    CM --> SC[SourceCard.jsx - doc name, page, section, excerpt, relevance %]
    CM --> CP[copy answer button - navigator.clipboard]
    CM --> RB[ReportButton.jsx]
    RB -->|POST /api/reports then GET download_url as blob| DL[browser saves PDF]
    CW --> QI[QuestionInput.jsx - textarea, Ctrl+Enter, disabled reasons]
    QI -->|onAsk -> POST /api/chat| UC

    UD -->|errors| TOAST[Toast - red/green, auto-dismiss 5s]
    UC -->|errors| TOAST
